---

<DocsLayout
  title="aegis init"
  description="Detect the project stack and write a Aegis configuration file."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "CLI reference", href: "/docs/cli/" }, { label: "init" }]}
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="name">NAME</h2>
  <p><code>aegis init</code> — create <code>aegis.yml</code> for a repository.</p>

  <h2 id="synopsis">SYNOPSIS</h2>
  <CodeBlock title="synopsis">aegis init [PATH]
    [--force] [--no-gitignore] [--rules=PACK,...]
    [--non-interactive] [GLOBAL_FLAGS ...]</CodeBlock>

  <h2 id="description">DESCRIPTION</h2>
  <p>
    <code>aegis init</code> inspects the repository for languages,
    frameworks, package manifests, and datastores, then writes a
    <code>aegis.yml</code> with a matching rule selection and test command.
  </p>
  <p>
    The command refuses to overwrite an existing configuration unless
    <code>--force</code> is given. It also appends <code>.aegis/</code> to
    <code>.gitignore</code>, since that directory holds local analysis state.
  </p>

  <h2 id="examples">EXAMPLES</h2>
  <CodeBlock title="shell">aegis init
aegis init ./services/api --rules core,web-api
aegis init --non-interactive --force</CodeBlock>

  <h2 id="flags">FLAGS</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>[PATH]</dt>
    <dd>Repository or subdirectory to initialize. Defaults to the current directory.</dd>
    <dt>--force</dt>
    <dd>Overwrite an existing <code>aegis.yml</code>.</dd>
    <dt>--no-gitignore</dt>
    <dd>Do not modify <code>.gitignore</code>.</dd>
    <dt>--rules=PACK,...</dt>
    <dd>Write this rule selection instead of the detected one.</dd>
    <dt>--non-interactive</dt>
    <dd>
      Never prompt. Detected values are accepted as-is, which makes the command
      safe to run in automation.
    </dd>
  </dl>

  <h2 id="exit-status">EXIT STATUS</h2>
  <p>
    <code>0</code> on success, <code>2</code> when a configuration already
    exists and <code>--force</code> was not given, <code>3</code> when the
    detected stack cannot be written as valid configuration.
  </p>

  <h2 id="see-also">SEE ALSO</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="/docs/cli/scan/">aegis scan</a>,
    <a href="/docs/configuration/">Configuration</a>.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
